        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T03:55:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Have a question about the prints. I recently bought the Enhanced Edition and noticed that certain card have a \"blurry/fuzzy\" text. While it is not something that is game-breaking/changing, it somewhat annoys me as it looks out of place and depending on the context of the card, it makes it a lot harder to read. Is the only fix to this is to buy a replacement set from GtG?<br><br>I attached a picture showing what I mean, comparing \"Slash and Burn\" (fuzzy) vs \"Backlash Field\" (clear). While it might not seem as prominent on the picture, looking at them in person the difference is obvious - \"Slash and Burn\" has a thicker/bold font. \"Powered Remote Turret\" is also like this, and I'm sure some cards in the other decks are like this too.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>[URL=http://imageshack.us/photo/my-images/89/201303182027182.jpg/][IMG]http://img89.imageshack.us/img89/946/201303182027182.jpg[/IMG][/URL]</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:41.746Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
